    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1604",
      "reading_order": 1858,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99996,
        "t": 414.7370200000001,
        "r": 556.0299800000005,
        "b": 391.4970200000001
      },
      "content": "The regreasable bearing has a single shield. Make sure that the bearing is installed with the shield away from the impeller.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1605",
      "reading_order": 1859,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99989,
        "t": 388.2489500000001,
        "r": 541.7999600000004,
        "b": 365.0089500000001
      },
      "content": "The duplex bearings are mounted back-to-back. Make sure that the orientation of the bearings are correct.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1606",
      "reading_order": 1860,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99989,
        "t": 361.7608800000001,
        "r": 541.2698900000003,
        "b": 338.5208800000001
      },
      "content": "Inspect the shaft (122) to ensure that it is clean, dimensionally correct, and is free of  nicks and burrs.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1607",
      "reading_order": 1861,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99946999999997,
        "t": 226.67241000000013,
        "r": 385.26947000000007,
        "b": 215.43241000000012
      },
      "content": "Lightly coat the bearing seating with a thin film of  oil.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1608",
      "reading_order": 1862,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99946999999997,
        "t": 213.42839000000015,
        "r": 364.19947,
        "b": 202.18839000000014
      },
      "content": "Remove the bearings (112) from their packaging.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1609",
      "reading_order": 1863,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99944999999997,
        "t": 200.18437000000017,
        "r": 447.95945000000006,
        "b": 188.94437000000016
      },
      "content": "Wipe the preservative from the bearing (112) bore and outer diameter.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1610",
      "reading_order": 1864,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99946999999997,
        "t": 186.9403500000002,
        "r": 543.8494700000005,
        "b": 163.70035000000018
      },
      "content": "Use an induction heater with a demagnetizing cycle to heat both bearings (112) to an inner ring temperature of 230 °F (110 °C).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1611",
      "reading_order": 1865,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99945,
        "t": 161.69633000000022,
        "r": 540.9394500000003,
        "b": 150.4563300000002
      },
      "content": "Place both bearings (112) on the shaft (122) with the large outer races together (back-to-back).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1612",
      "reading_order": 1866,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99941,
        "t": 148.45231000000024,
        "r": 536.5694100000002,
        "b": 125.21231000000023
      },
      "content": "Position the bearings (112) on the shaft (122) against the shoulder and snug the locknut (136) against the bearings until they are cool.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1842",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1842",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 108,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
